---
/*
 * LegalStatus — the single source of truth for who operates avaTOK.
 *
 * [LEGAL-UNREG-1 2026-08-28] Every legal page used to open by naming
 * "Ava Global International Pvt Ltd" (Mumbai) and, on the commerce pages, a
 * second contracting entity in Delaware. Neither described reality: there is no
 * registered Indian company, and the owner's decision (2026-08-28) is that the
 * site names no other entity either. This component states the true position —
 * unregistered, testing stage, incorporation intended once funded — and every
 * page imports it instead of writing its own version. One edit updates the site.
 *
 * `variant`:
 *   'full'  — who we are + current status + address. Use on terms, privacy,
 *             about, refunds and the other commerce/policy pages.
 *   'who'   — who we are + address only. For pages that already describe the
 *             testing stage in their own words.
 *   'short' — one paragraph, for pages where the block would crowd the page.
 */
export interface Props {
  variant?: 'full' | 'who' | 'short';
  heading?: string;
}

const { variant = 'full', heading } = Astro.props;
---

{heading && <h2 id="status">{heading}</h2>}

<div class="note" id={heading ? undefined : 'status'}>
  {variant === 'short' ? (
    <p>
      avaTOK is built and operated by an independent founding team in India. We are
      an <strong>unregistered business</strong> at the ideation and testing stage, and
      we intend to register a company in Mumbai, India once funding is in place. The
      service is invite-only and is not yet fully operational. Contact:
      <a href="mailto:support@avatok.ai">support@avatok.ai</a>.
    </p>
  ) : (
    <Fragment>
      <p>
        <strong>Who you are dealing with.</strong> avaTOK is built and operated by an
        independent founding team in India. We are a brand-new startup at the
        ideation and testing stage: we are still building the product and validating
        the idea with a small, invited group of users.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:12px">
        <strong>We are currently an unregistered business in India.</strong> No company
        has been incorporated yet, so avaTOK is not operated by any registered
        company, and no entity name should be read into our branding. We have begun
        the formalities to register a company in Mumbai, India, and intend to complete
        registration as soon as our funding is in place. When that happens we will
        update these pages and tell affected users. If you are an investor and would
        like to talk to us, write to <a href="mailto:hello@avatok.ai">hello@avatok.ai</a>.
      </p>

      {variant === 'full' && (
        <p style="margin-top:12px">
          <strong>The site is not fully operational.</strong> Features are being tested
          and may change, be paused, or be removed. Access is currently
          <strong> invite-only</strong>. Our online payment facility is not live to the
          public: our application for a payment gateway as an unregistered business is
          <strong> under review</strong>, and until it is approved, payment flows are in
          test. Prices, fees and token values shown on the site are indicative during
          this period. Test data may be reset.
        </p>
      )}

      <p style="margin-top:12px">
        <strong>Operating address.</strong> Ekta Vihar, Sahastradhara Road, Dehradun,
        Uttarakhand, India.<br />
        <strong>Contact.</strong> <a href="mailto:support@avatok.ai">support@avatok.ai</a>
        (support and billing) · <a href="mailto:hello@avatok.ai">hello@avatok.ai</a>
        (general and investor enquiries) ·
        <a href="mailto:privacy@avatok.ai">privacy@avatok.ai</a> (privacy).
      </p>
    </Fragment>
  )}
</div>
